---
import Counter from '../components/Counter.jsx';
const title = 'Welcome to Romana (Astro)';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import HeroCarousel from '../components/HeroCarousel.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Koulen&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <Navbar />
    <main>
  <HeroCarousel />

      <section class="our-story">
     
        <div class="container">
          <h3>Romana Devera</h3>
          <div class="story-grid">
            <p class="story-intro">HOW IT ALL BEGAN</p>
            <div class="story-image">
              <img src="/image%209.png" alt="Romana" />
            </div>
            <div class="story-text">
              <p>What started as a small family recipe has grown into Romana — hand-crafted brittle and snacks made with simple ingredients and a lot of heart. We source quality peanuts and nuts, then cook them slowly to achieve the perfect crunch and caramelized flavor.</p>
              <p>Our mission is to share those flavors with friends and neighbors while supporting local producers.</p>
              <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer euismod, nisl at convallis tincidunt, justo arcu cursus elit, id luctus nunc nisl sed orci. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Donec a facilisis lectus.</p>
              <p>Curabitur sit amet nibh sed justo fermentum malesuada. Sed vitae mi sit amet urna pharetra gravida. Phasellus ut sem vitae augue faucibus gravida. Aliquam erat volutpat. Maecenas in dui sed urna consequat tincidunt.</p>
              <!-- removed CTA as requested -->
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    <section class="crafted-with-care">
      <div class="brittle-info">
        <div class="brittle-text">
          <h2>Crafted with Care</h2>
          <p class="brittle-desc">Every batch of Romana's peanut brittle is crafted with care and attention to quality. We start with the finest roasted peanuts, carefully selected for their superior flavor and crunch. Our traditional recipe combines these premium nuts with pure butter and caramelized sugar, cooked to perfection in small batches to ensure consistent quality and taste.</p>
          <p class="brittle-desc"><strong>Made Fresh:</strong> We prepare our brittle in small quantities to guarantee freshness and quality. Each batch is hand-crafted using time-tested techniques passed down through generations of candy makers.</p>
          <p class="brittle-desc"><strong>Delivered to Your Door:</strong> Once packaged with care, your order is prepared for delivery. We partner with trusted shipping carriers to ensure your peanut brittle arrives in perfect condition, ready to enjoy or share with loved ones.</p>
          <a class="btn-brittle" href="/products">Explore Products</a>
        </div>
        <img src="/peanut-brittle.webp" alt="Peanut Brittle" class="brittle-featured-image" />
      </div>
    </section>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>
